          "id": "4pn1jx1jj2dr",
          "status": "monitoring",
          "body": "We continue to see signs of improvement for incoming email processing with lower failure rates. Teams continue to monitor recovery from Microsoft, and we will share the next update when there is a significant change.\n\nFor more details on the service degradation reported by Microsoft, please refer to https://status.cloud.microsoft/",
